{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":5,"lang":"id","title":"Punya siapa","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Apa yang akan kamu pelajari","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Di pelajaran ini kamu belajar bilang siapa punya apa dan barang itu milik siapa: «aku punya saudara laki-laki», «ini cangkirku», «helm ini milikku», «cangkir suamiku», «keyboard ini punya siapa?». Bahasa Inggris punya beberapa kata berbeda untuk ini."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She has a brother.","translation":"Dia punya saudara laki-laki.","hi":"has"},{"en":"This is my mug.","translation":"Ini cangkirku.","hi":"my"},{"en":"The helmet is mine.","translation":"Helm ini milikku.","hi":"mine"},{"en":"The mug is my husband's.","translation":"Cangkir ini punya suamiku.","hi":"'s"},{"en":"Whose keyboard is this?","translation":"Keyboard ini punya siapa?","hi":"Whose"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"«Aku punya» — I have","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«Aku punya kunci» — I have a key. Jangan lupa a sebelum benda, seperti di pelajaran 3. Dan jangan pakai there is — itu artinya «di sini ada», bukan «aku punya»."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"siapa","accent":true},{"text":"have / has","accent":true},{"text":"apa","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I have a key.","translation":"Aku punya kunci.","hi":"have"},{"en":"We have a sister.","translation":"Kami punya saudara perempuan.","hi":"have"},{"en":"I have a computer.","translation":"Aku punya komputer.","hi":"have"},{"en":"They have wallets.","translation":"Mereka punya dompet.","hi":"have"},{"en":"I have a guest.","translation":"Aku sedang ada tamu.","hi":"have"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I have key.","right":"I have a key."}]}]},{"num":"03","title":"have atau has","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«Punya» tidak pernah berubah. Bahasa Inggris berubah: dengan he, she, it, atau satu orang dan satu benda — has: she has, the hotel has. Dengan yang lain — have: I have, you have, we have, they have."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She has a baby.","translation":"Dia punya bayi.","hi":"has"},{"en":"He has a cat.","translation":"Dia punya kucing.","hi":"has"},{"en":"The hotel has a dog.","translation":"Hotel itu punya anjing.","hi":"has"},{"en":"The desk has paper.","translation":"Di meja ada kertas.","hi":"has"},{"en":"The twins have a dog.","translation":"Si kembar punya anjing.","hi":"have"},{"en":"My nephew has a puppy.","translation":"Keponakanku punya anak anjing.","hi":"has"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She have a brother.","right":"She has a brother."},{"wrong":"I has a key.","right":"I have a key."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"a baby.","options":["have","has","is"],"answer":"has","why":"Dengan she pakai has."}}]},{"num":"04","title":"my, your, his, her — di DEPAN benda","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kita bilang «cangkirku» — «-ku» menempel di belakang. Bahasa Inggris menaruhnya di depan: my mug. my tidak berubah, satu atau banyak benda: my mug, my pencils."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"This is my mug.","translation":"Ini cangkirku.","hi":"my"},{"en":"Your tissue is in my pocket.","translation":"Tisumu ada di sakuku.","hi":"Your"},{"en":"Her lunchbox is in the fridge.","translation":"Kotak bekalnya ada di kulkas. *(dia perempuan)*","hi":"Her"},{"en":"His tattoo is small.","translation":"Tatonya kecil. *(dia laki-laki)*","hi":"His"},{"en":"These are my pencils.","translation":"Ini pensil-pensilku.","hi":"my"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"This is mug my.","right":"This is my mug."},{"wrong":"These are mys pencils.","right":"These are my pencils."}]}]},{"num":"05","title":"«-nya»: his atau her","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«-nya» dipakai untuk siapa saja: tatonya, kuncirnya. Bahasa Inggris memisahkan: punya laki-laki — his, punya perempuan — her. Lihat siapa pemiliknya, bukan bendanya."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"His tattoo is small.","translation":"Tatonya kecil. *(laki-laki)*","hi":"His"},{"en":"Her ponytail is long.","translation":"Kuncir kudanya panjang. *(perempuan)*","hi":"Her"},{"en":"This is her puppy.","translation":"Ini anak anjingnya. *(perempuan)*","hi":"her"},{"en":"It is her bookcase.","translation":"Itu rak bukunya. *(perempuan)*","hi":"her"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Kamu bicara tentang kuncir kuda seorang gadis. Mana yang benar?","optionA":"His ponytail is long.","optionB":"Her ponytail is long.","correct":"B","explain":"Kuncirnya milik perempuan, jadi her."}}]},{"num":"06","title":"our, their, its","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"our — «kami / kita», their — «mereka». its — «-nya» untuk benda atau hewan: its collar — kalung anak anjing itu. its ditulis tanpa tanda '. It's dengan tanda ' artinya it is."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Our printer is next to the window.","translation":"Printer kami ada di samping jendela.","hi":"Our"},{"en":"Its collar is red.","translation":"Kalungnya merah. *(anak anjing)*","hi":"Its"},{"en":"Its tail is short.","translation":"Ekornya pendek. *(anak anjing)*","hi":"Its"},{"en":"Where is my laptop?","translation":"Laptopku di mana?","hi":"my"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"It's collar is red.","right":"Its collar is red."}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Coba ganti dengan it is. Bisa — tulis it's. Tidak bisa — its."}]},{"num":"07","title":"mine, yours, hers — «milikku»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«Helm ini milikku» — The helmet is mine, bukan my. Bandingkan: my helmet — «helmku», tapi The helmet is mine — «helm ini milikku». Sesudah mine bendanya tidak diulang."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"my → mine","accent":false},{"text":"your → yours","accent":false},{"text":"his → his","accent":false},{"text":"her → hers","accent":false},{"text":"our → ours","accent":false},{"text":"their → theirs","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"The helmet is mine.","translation":"Helm ini milikku.","hi":"mine"},{"en":"The guitar is yours.","translation":"Gitar ini milikmu.","hi":"yours"},{"en":"The razor is his.","translation":"Pisau cukur ini miliknya. *(laki-laki)*","hi":"his"},{"en":"The perfume is hers.","translation":"Parfum ini miliknya. *(perempuan)*","hi":"hers"},{"en":"The kite is ours.","translation":"Layang-layang ini milik kami.","hi":"ours"},{"en":"The puzzle is theirs.","translation":"Puzzle ini milik mereka.","hi":"theirs"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"The helmet is my.","right":"The helmet is mine."},{"wrong":"The perfume is her.","right":"The perfume is hers."},{"wrong":"This is mine helmet.","right":"This is my helmet."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"The guitar is","after":".","options":["your","yours","you"],"answer":"yours","why":"Bendanya sudah disebut, «milikmu» di akhir — yours."}}]},{"num":"08","title":"Milik seseorang: my husband's","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kita bilang «cangkir suamiku» — benda dulu, orangnya belakangan. Bahasa Inggris kebalikannya: orang dulu, tambah 's, baru benda: my husband's mug. Kalau bendanya sudah disebut, boleh tidak diulang: The mug is my husband's."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"orang + 's","accent":false},{"text":"benda","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"The mug is my husband's.","translation":"Cangkir ini punya suamiku.","hi":"'s"},{"en":"This is my sister's thermos.","translation":"Ini termos kakakku.","hi":"'s"},{"en":"The dog is the neighbour's.","translation":"Anjing ini punya tetangga.","hi":"'s"},{"en":"My aunt's piano is old.","translation":"Piano bibiku sudah tua.","hi":"'s"},{"en":"The baby's bib is in my sister's bag.","translation":"Celemek bayi ada di tas kakakku.","hi":"'s"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"The thermos of my sister.","right":"My sister's thermos."},{"wrong":"This is thermos my sister.","right":"This is my sister's thermos."},{"wrong":"The dog is the neighbour.","right":"The dog is the neighbour's."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Katakan: «Ini termos kakakku».","answer":["This","is","my","sister's","thermos"],"distractors":["sister","of"]}}]},{"num":"09","title":"Whose — «punya siapa»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kita bertanya «punya siapa?» di akhir: «Keyboard ini punya siapa?». Bahasa Inggris menaruh Whose di depan, langsung diikuti bendanya: Whose keyboard is this? Untuk banyak benda — are these: Whose gloves are these?"},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"Whose","accent":true},{"text":"benda","accent":true},{"text":"is this / are these","accent":true},{"text":"?","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Whose keyboard is this?","translation":"Keyboard ini punya siapa?","hi":"Whose"},{"en":"Whose gloves are these?","translation":"Sarung tangan ini punya siapa?","hi":"Whose"},{"en":"Whose monitor is that?","translation":"Monitor itu punya siapa?","hi":"Whose"},{"en":"It is hers.","translation":"Miliknya. *(perempuan)*","hi":"hers"},{"en":"They are mine.","translation":"Milikku.","hi":"mine"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"This keyboard is whose?","right":"Whose keyboard is this?"},{"wrong":"Whose is this keyboard?","right":"Whose keyboard is this?"},{"wrong":"Who's keyboard is this?","right":"Whose keyboard is this?"}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Who's dan whose bunyinya sama, tapi who's artinya who is. «Punya siapa» selalu ditulis whose."}]},{"num":"10","title":"Jawaban untuk «punya siapa?» — singkat","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Untuk Whose…? jawabannya biasanya singkat: It is hers. They are mine. It is my brother's. Bendanya tidak diulang karena sudah ada di pertanyaan."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Whose badge is this? It is mine.","translation":"Lencana ini punya siapa? — Milikku.","hi":"mine"},{"en":"Whose pendant is this? It is hers.","translation":"Liontin ini punya siapa? — Miliknya.","hi":"hers"},{"en":"Whose binoculars are these? They are mine.","translation":"Teropong ini punya siapa? — Milikku.","hi":"mine"},{"en":"Is this pendant yours? No, it isn't mine.","translation":"Liontin ini milikmu? — Bukan, bukan milikku.","hi":"isn't"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"It is my.","right":"It is mine."}]}]},{"num":"11","title":"'s ada dua macam","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"my sister's bag — «tas kakakku»: di sini 's artinya «punya». Tapi My cousin's here — «sepupuku ada di sini»: di sini 's adalah is yang disingkat. Cara membedakan: sesudah 's ada benda — «punya». Sesudahnya tempat atau sifat — is."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"My friend's flute is here.","translation":"Seruling temanku ada di sini.","hi":"'s"},{"en":"My cousin's here.","translation":"Sepupuku ada di sini.","hi":"'s"},{"en":"The rabbit's bowl is empty.","translation":"Mangkuk kelinci itu kosong.","hi":"'s"}]}]},{"num":"12","title":"Kesalahan yang dibuat hampir semua orang","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She have a brother.","right":"She has a brother."},{"wrong":"This is mug my.","right":"This is my mug."},{"wrong":"The helmet is my.","right":"The helmet is mine."},{"wrong":"It's collar is red.","right":"Its collar is red."},{"wrong":"The thermos of my sister.","right":"My sister's thermos."},{"wrong":"This keyboard is whose?","right":"Whose keyboard is this?"}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Di depan benda — my, your, his, her, our, their. Tanpa benda, di akhir — mine, yours, his, hers, ours, theirs. Milik seseorang — 's: my sister's."},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Kamu menunjuk helm dan bilang itu milikmu. Mana yang benar?","optionA":"The helmet is my.","optionB":"The helmet is mine.","correct":"B","explain":"Di akhir, tanpa benda — mine."}}]},{"num":"13","title":"Bekal untuk latihan","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«Aku punya» — I have, dia — has. «Helmku» — my helmet, di depan. «Helm ini milikku» — the helmet is mine. «-nya»: laki-laki his, perempuan her. «Kakakku» — my sister's. «Punya siapa?» — Whose… is this?"},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"He has a phone.","translation":"Dia punya ponsel.","hi":"has"},{"en":"Her aunt is in the kitchen.","translation":"Bibinya ada di dapur. *(perempuan)*","hi":"Her"},{"en":"The rackets are ours.","translation":"Raket-raket ini milik kami.","hi":"ours"},{"en":"The saw is my uncle's.","translation":"Gergaji ini punya pamanku.","hi":"'s"},{"en":"Whose trophy is this?","translation":"Piala ini punya siapa?","hi":"Whose"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{"1":"02","2":"02","3":"03","4":"03","5":"03","6":"03","7":"03","8":"03","9":"04","10":"04","11":"10","12":"04","13":"04","14":"06","15":"05","16":"04","17":"07","18":"07","19":"07","20":"07","21":"07","22":"07","23":"07","24":"07","25":"08","26":"08","27":"10","28":"10","29":"11","30":"10","31":"10","32":"10","33":"09","34":"09","35":"09","36":"09","37":"09","38":"09","39":"09","40":"09","41":"09","42":"09","43":"09","44":"09","45":"09","46":"09","47":"09","48":"09","49":"09","50":"09","51":"09","52":"09","53":"09","54":"09","55":"09","56":"09"}}
